      "text": "Who’s coming over? It’s KAI and he’s ready to set the stage on fire! 🔥\n\nThe 2025 KAI SOLO CONCERT TOUR <KAION> IN MANILA is just around the corner! See you EXO-L on July 27 at the Smart Araneta Coliseum (@TheBigDome)! 👋\n\nGrab your tickets now at @TicketNetPH outlets or online via https://t.co/jn6ny7yHaC \n\n#KAI #카이 #EXO #엑소 #weareoneEXO\n#KAION #KAI_SOLO_CONCERT_TOUR\n#2025_KAI_SOLO_CONCERT_TOUR_KAION\n#KAIinMANILA2025",
