      "text": "Padayon, QCitizens! 🧑🏻‍🎓✨\n\nSuportado ng lokal na pamahalaan ang kabataang QCitizens sa pagkamit ng kanilang pangarap sa buhay.\n\nPatuloy ang proyekto at programa ng lungsod,  lalo na sa pagbibigay ng scholarships, skills training, at job opportunities para sa magandang kinabukasan.  \n\nPanoorin ang weekly recap na ito para sa linggo ng May 19, 2025. Makikita ang iba pang detalye sa:\n\n• Graduation of Alternative Learning System (ALS):\nhttps://t.co/5E1nGD6Trr\n\n• City-wide Basketball Cup - Schools Division:\nhttps://t.co/2Mtu40oVVa\n\n• QCDRRMO - New Equipments:\nhttps://t.co/w9fbyCWcro\n\n• Children's Disaster Resilience Fair - Batang QC, Laging Ready:\nhttps://t.co/FeOPoIFU7f\n\n• QC Health Department Healthcare Forum:\nhttps://t.co/lUsNDo0s8c\n\n• Talastasan sa QC:\nhttps://t.co/Js4KyLtODT\n\nhttps://t.co/uprbDjQCCk\n\nhttps://t.co/ThBHl5IcWJ\n\nhttps://t.co/e1n70NHYXY\n\n• Essential Kits Distribution:\nhttps://t.co/4KOxbKZuwu\n\n• Chiba City, Japan fire truck donation to QC Hall:\nhttps://t.co/nPqB5skfSm\n\n#BusyQCWeeklyRecap",
